---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Soluții IT complete, adaptate afacerii tale" description="AXA IT oferă mentenanță IT, rețelistică, cloud, securitate și monitorizare automată 24/7. 150+ sisteme active, 8+ ani experiență (din 2016), suport tehnic Lu-Vi 08-18.">

  <Header variant="dark" />

  <main>

    <!-- ═══════════════════ HERO ═══════════════════ -->
    <section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center bg-ink-900 overflow-hidden pt-24">
      <!-- z-0: brand grid bg -->
      <div class="brand-grid-bg absolute inset-0 opacity-60 z-0"></div>
      <div class="absolute top-1/3 -left-32 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-[180px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-cyan-500/5 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>
      <!-- bottom fade -->
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink-900 to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="relative z-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16 w-full">

        <!-- Left content (editorial) -->
        <div class="lg:w-1/2">
          <p class="brand-eyebrow mb-8">Soluții IT</p>

          <h1 class="font-display text-[40px] md:text-[56px] lg:text-[68px] font-medium leading-[1.05] tracking-tight bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-surface-100 to-surface-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
            Infrastructura ta digitală,<br/>
            <span class="text-brand-cyan-500">grija noastră.</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-8 text-[18px] md:text-[20px] text-surface-300 max-w-xl leading-relaxed font-light">
            Din 2016 construim, securizăm și întreținem infrastructuri IT pentru companii din România. Mentenanță preventivă, rețelistică avansată și monitorizare automată 24/7.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <a href="/contact" class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan-500 hover:bg-brand-cyan-400 text-ink-900 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-semibold px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-cyan-500/25">
              Solicită consultație
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 8.25L21 12m0 0l-3.75 3.75M21 12H3"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="#servicii" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-brand-cyan-500/30 hover:border-brand-cyan-500/60 text-surface-300 hover:text-brand-cyan-500 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-medium px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full transition-all">
              Descoperă serviciile
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Hero meta grid 4col (mono labels) -->
          <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-px bg-brand-cyan-500/10 border border-brand-cyan-500/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-ink-900 p-4">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-surface-500 mb-1">EST.</p>
              <p class="font-display text-[22px] text-surface-50 font-medium">2016</p>
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-cyan-500 mt-1">Est.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-ink-900 p-4">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-surface-500 mb-1">SISTEME</p>
              <p class="font-display text-[22px] text-surface-50 font-medium">150<span class="text-brand-cyan-500">+</span></p>
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-cyan-500 mt-1">Active</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-ink-900 p-4">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-surface-500 mb-1">INDUSTRII</p>
              <p class="font-display text-[22px] text-surface-50 font-medium">7</p>
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-cyan-500 mt-1">Sectors</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-ink-900 p-4">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-surface-500 mb-1">MONITORIZARE</p>
              <p class="font-display text-[22px] text-surface-50 font-medium">24/7</p>
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-cyan-500 mt-1">Automată</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Signal Mesh SVG animation -->
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 hidden lg:flex items-center justify-center signal-mesh-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" class="signal-mesh w-full max-w-[440px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="AXA IT — Signal Mesh: rețea de noduri și fluxuri de date">
            <style>
              .signal-mesh .g-root {
                animation: fade-in 1.2s ease-out both, float 12s ease-in-out 1.2s infinite;
                transform-origin: 200px 200px;
              }
              .signal-mesh .halo { opacity: 0.35; transition: opacity 600ms ease-out; }
              .signal-mesh .status-pulse {
                animation: pulse-node 3.6s ease-in-out infinite;
                transform-origin: center;
                transform-box: fill-box;
              }
              .signal-mesh .status-pulse.delay-1 { animation-delay: 1.8s; }
              .signal-mesh .travel {
                animation: travel 6s linear infinite;
                transition: animation-duration 600ms ease-out;
              }
              .signal-mesh .travel.t1 { offset-path: path('M80 90 L180 200'); animation-duration: 5.5s; animation-delay: 0s; }
              .signal-mesh .travel.t2 { offset-path: path('M180 200 L320 240'); animation-duration: 6.8s; animation-delay: 2.1s; }
              .signal-mesh .travel.t3 { offset-path: path('M180 200 L230 320'); animation-duration: 7.2s; animation-delay: 3.8s; }

              .signal-mesh-wrap:hover .signal-mesh .halo { opacity: 0.6; }
              .signal-mesh-wrap:hover .signal-mesh .travel.t1 { animation-duration: 3.85s; }
              .signal-mesh-wrap:hover .signal-mesh .travel.t2 { animation-duration: 4.76s; }
              .signal-mesh-wrap:hover .signal-mesh .travel.t3 { animation-duration: 5.04s; }

              @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
                .signal-mesh .g-root,
                .signal-mesh .status-pulse { animation: none !important; }
                .signal-mesh .travel { opacity: 0 !important; animation: none !important; }
                .signal-mesh .halo { opacity: 0.25 !important; }
              }
            </style>

            <defs>
              <radialGradient id="meshHalo" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="var(--cyan-500)" stop-opacity="0.55"/>
                <stop offset="60%" stop-color="var(--cyan-500)" stop-opacity="0.12"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="var(--cyan-500)" stop-opacity="0"/>
              </radialGradient>
            </defs>

            <g class="g-root">

              <!-- Static lines (5) -->
              <g stroke="var(--ink-500)" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none">
                <line x1="80"  y1="90"  x2="200" y2="60"  opacity="0.3"/><!-- n1-n2 -->
                <line x1="200" y1="60"  x2="330" y2="110" opacity="0.3"/><!-- n2-n3 -->
                <line x1="330" y1="110" x2="320" y2="240" opacity="0.3"/><!-- n3-n6 -->
                <line x1="60"  y1="220" x2="110" y2="340" opacity="0.3"/><!-- n4-n7 -->
                <line x1="320" y1="240" x2="340" y2="350" opacity="0.3"/><!-- n6-n9 -->
              </g>

              <!-- Active trace lines (under travel dots) -->
              <g stroke="var(--ink-500)" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none" opacity="0.4">
                <line x1="80"  y1="90"  x2="180" y2="200"/><!-- n1-n5 -->
                <line x1="180" y1="200" x2="320" y2="240"/><!-- n5-n6 -->
                <line x1="180" y1="200" x2="230" y2="320"/><!-- n5-n8 -->
              </g>

              <!-- Halos on n2, n5, n8 -->
              <circle class="halo" cx="200" cy="60"  r="22" fill="url(#meshHalo)"/>
              <circle class="halo" cx="180" cy="200" r="22" fill="url(#meshHalo)"/>
              <circle class="halo" cx="230" cy="320" r="22" fill="url(#meshHalo)"/>

              <!-- 9 nodes -->
              <circle cx="80"  cy="90"  r="4" fill="var(--cyan-500)"/>
              <circle cx="200" cy="60"  r="4" fill="var(--cyan-500)"/>
              <circle cx="330" cy="110" r="4" fill="var(--cyan-500)"/>
              <circle cx="60"  cy="220" r="4" fill="var(--cyan-500)"/>
              <circle cx="180" cy="200" r="4" fill="var(--cyan-500)"/>
              <circle cx="320" cy="240" r="4" fill="var(--cyan-500)"/>
              <circle cx="110" cy="340" r="4" fill="var(--cyan-500)"/>
              <circle cx="230" cy="320" r="4" fill="var(--cyan-500)"/>
              <circle cx="340" cy="350" r="4" fill="var(--cyan-500)"/>

              <!-- Status pulses on n2 and n8 -->
              <circle class="status-pulse" cx="200" cy="60" r="4" fill="var(--signal-up)"/>
              <circle class="status-pulse delay-1" cx="230" cy="320" r="4" fill="var(--signal-up)"/>

              <!-- Travel dots (3 active routes) -->
              <circle class="travel t1" r="2" fill="var(--signal-info)"/>
              <circle class="travel t2" r="2" fill="var(--signal-info)"/>
              <circle class="travel t3" r="2" fill="var(--signal-info)"/>

            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Scroll cue -->
      <div class="scroll-cue absolute bottom-32 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-30 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 pointer-events-none">
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-surface-400">Scroll</span>
        <span class="scroll-cue-bar"></span>
      </div>
      <style>
        .scroll-cue-bar {
          width: 1px;
          height: 36px;
          background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--cyan-500) 0%, transparent 100%);
          display: block;
          animation: scroll-cue-pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
          transform-origin: top;
        }
        @keyframes scroll-cue-pulse {
          0%, 100% { transform: scaleY(0.4); opacity: 0.5; }
          50%      { transform: scaleY(1);   opacity: 1;   }
        }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
          .scroll-cue-bar { animation: none; opacity: 0.6; }
        }
      </style>
    </section>



    <!-- ═══════════════════ PARTNERS BAND ═══════════════════ -->
    <section class="py-12 bg-ink-800 border-y border-brand-cyan-500/10">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <p class="brand-eyebrow text-center mb-6">— Parteneri tehnologici</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-3 font-mono text-surface-300 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">
          <span>Microsoft</span>
          <span class="text-brand-cyan-500/40">/</span>
          <span>Fortinet</span>
          <span class="text-brand-cyan-500/40">/</span>
          <span>Ubiquiti</span>
          <span class="text-brand-cyan-500/40">/</span>
          <span>TP-Link</span>
          <span class="text-brand-cyan-500/40">/</span>
          <span>Acronis</span>
          <span class="text-brand-cyan-500/40">/</span>
          <span>Bitdefender</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ═══════════════════ SERVICES GRID ═══════════════════ -->
    <section id="servicii" class="py-24 bg-ink-900 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="brand-grid-bg absolute inset-0 opacity-30 pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="brand-section-head index mb-14">
          <p><strong>01</strong> / Capabilities</p>
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-2xl mb-14">
          <h2 class="font-display text-[32px] md:text-[44px] font-medium text-surface-50 leading-tight">
            Servicii IT complete
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-surface-300 text-[17px] font-light">
            De la mentenanță preventivă la securitate completă — acoperim întreaga infrastructură IT a afacerii tale.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

          <a href="/servicii/mentenanta-suport-it" class="brand-card brand-card-glow group block overflow-hidden">
            <img src="/img/servicii/mentenanta-suport-it.jpg" alt="Mentenanță & Suport IT" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-brand-cyan-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan-500">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.42 15.17L17.25 21A2.652 2.652 0 0021 17.25l-5.877-5.877M11.42 15.17l2.496-3.03c.317-.384.74-.626 1.208-.766M11.42 15.17l-4.655 5.653a2.548 2.548 0 11-3.586-3.586l6.837-5.63m5.108-.233c.55-.164 1.163-.188 1.743-.14a4.5 4.5 0 004.486-6.336l-3.276 3.277a3.004 3.004 0 01-2.25-2.25l3.276-3.276a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.336 4.486c.091 1.076-.071 2.264-.904 2.95l-.102.085"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-surface-50 font-medium text-[18px] group-hover:text-brand-cyan-500 transition-colors">Mentenanță & Suport IT</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-surface-300 text-[14px] leading-relaxed mb-4 font-light">Mentenanță preventivă, intervenții în timp util și monitorizare automată 24/7. Sistemele tale funcționează stabil, cu incidențe detectate proactiv.</p>
              <span class="font-mono text-brand-cyan-500 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">
                Află mai mult <span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="/servicii/retelistica-wifi" class="brand-card brand-card-glow group block overflow-hidden">
            <img src="/img/servicii/retelistica-wifi.jpg" alt="Rețelistică & Wi-Fi" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-brand-cyan-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan-500">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.288 15.038a5.25 5.25 0 017.424 0M5.106 11.856c3.807-3.808 9.98-3.808 13.788 0M1.924 8.674c5.565-5.565 14.587-5.565 20.152 0M12.53 18.22l-.53.53-.53-.53a.75.75 0 011.06 0z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-surface-50 font-medium text-[18px] group-hover:text-brand-cyan-500 transition-colors">Rețelistică & Wi-Fi</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-surface-300 text-[14px] leading-relaxed mb-4 font-light">Rețele cablate și wireless performante, adaptate mediului tău — de la birouri la hale logistice și spații industriale.</p>
              <span class="font-mono text-brand-cyan-500 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">
                Află mai mult <span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="/servicii/cloud-backup" class="brand-card brand-card-glow group block overflow-hidden">
            <img src="/img/servicii/cloud-backup.jpg" alt="Cloud & Backup" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-brand-cyan-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan-500">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 15a4.5 4.5 0 004.5 4.5H18a3.75 3.75 0 001.332-7.257 3 3 0 00-3.758-3.848 5.25 5.25 0 00-10.233 2.33A4.502 4.502 0 002.25 15z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-surface-50 font-medium text-[18px] group-hover:text-brand-cyan-500 transition-colors">Cloud & Backup</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-surface-300 text-[14px] leading-relaxed mb-4 font-light">Soluții cloud și backup automatizat cu Acronis. Date securizate, accesibile de oriunde și conforme GDPR.</p>
              <span class="font-mono text-brand-cyan-500 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">
                Află mai mult <span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="/servicii/securitate-supraveghere" class="brand-card brand-card-glow group block overflow-hidden">
            <img src="/img/servicii/securitate-supraveghere.jpg" alt="Securitate & Supraveghere" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-brand-cyan-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan-500">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 10.5l4.72-4.72a.75.75 0 011.28.53v11.38a.75.75 0 01-1.28.53l-4.72-4.72M4.5 18.75h9a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-9a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25h-9A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 7.5v9a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-surface-50 font-medium text-[18px] group-hover:text-brand-cyan-500 transition-colors">Securitate & Supraveghere</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-surface-300 text-[14px] leading-relaxed mb-4 font-light">Supraveghere video, control acces, pontaj și automatizări integrate. Securitate fizică și digitală într-un singur pachet.</p>
              <span class="font-mono text-brand-cyan-500 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">
                Află mai mult <span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="/servicii/outsourcing-it" class="brand-card brand-card-glow group block overflow-hidden">
            <img src="/img/servicii/outsourcing-it.jpg" alt="Outsourcing IT" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-brand-cyan-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan-500">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18 18.72a9.094 9.094 0 003.741-.479 3 3 0 00-4.682-2.72m.94 3.198l.001.031c0 .225-.012.447-.037.666A11.944 11.944 0 0112 21c-2.17 0-4.207-.576-5.963-1.584A6.062 6.062 0 016 18.719m12 0a5.971 5.971 0 00-.941-3.197m0 0A5.995 5.995 0 0012 12.75a5.995 5.995 0 00-5.058 2.772m0 0a3 3 0 00-4.681 2.72 8.986 8.986 0 003.74.477m.94-3.197a5.971 5.971 0 00-.94 3.197M15 6.75a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0zm-13.5 0a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-surface-50 font-medium text-[18px] group-hover:text-brand-cyan-500 transition-colors">Outsourcing IT</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-surface-300 text-[14px] leading-relaxed mb-4 font-light">Departament IT externalizat, fără costurile angajării interne. Suport tehnic în program Lu–Vi și monitorizare automată 24/7.</p>
              <span class="font-mono text-brand-cyan-500 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">
                Află mai mult <span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="/servicii/protectie-cibernetica" class="brand-card brand-card-glow group block overflow-hidden">
            <img src="/img/servicii/protectie-cibernetica.jpg" alt="Protecție Cibernetică" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-brand-cyan-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan-500">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-surface-50 font-medium text-[18px] group-hover:text-brand-cyan-500 transition-colors">Protecție Cibernetică</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-surface-300 text-[14px] leading-relaxed mb-4 font-light">Firewall-uri Fortinet, politici de acces, monitorizare rețea și antivirus centralizat Bitdefender. Conformitate NIS2.</p>
              <span class="font-mono text-brand-cyan-500 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">
                Află mai mult <span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
              </span>
            </div>
